sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Instance A
    participant B as Instance B
    participant P as PgBouncer (transaction mode)
    participant S1 as Backend 1234
    participant S2 as Backend 5678

    A->>P: SELECT pg_try_advisory_lock(42)
    P->>S1: SELECT pg_try_advisory_lock(42)
    S1-->>A: true (Backend 1234 holds lock 42)
    B->>P: BEGIN
    P->>S1: B owns Backend 1234 until COMMIT
    A->>P: SELECT pg_advisory_unlock(42)
    P->>S2: SELECT pg_advisory_unlock(42)
    S2-->>A: false, WARNING: you don't own a lock
    B->>P: COMMIT
    Note over S1: Lock 42 is still held by Backend 1234
